.TH HOLDER-DESKTOP 1 "July 2026" "Holder Desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
holder-desktop \- GTK desktop frontend for Holder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B holder-desktop
[\fB--width\fR \fIPIXELS\fR]
[\fB--height\fR \fIPIXELS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B holder-desktop
starts the GTK desktop frontend for Holder. The application connects to the
local Holder daemon to manage projects, cards, search, resources, git sync, and
AI workflows.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --width " " \fIPIXELS\fR
Start the window with the requested width.
.TP
.BR --height " " \fIPIXELS\fR
Start the window with the requested height.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR holderd (1),
.BR holderctl (1)
